## Erlang VM arguments for Symphony release

## Set a limit on the number of simultaneously existing processes and ports
+P 1048576
+Q 65536

## Heartbeat management; auto-restarts VM if it dies or becomes unresponsive
## (Disabled by default; enable if needed)
##-heart

## Enable SMP (Symmetric Multi-Processing)
-smp auto

## Increase number of concurrent ports/sockets
-env ERL_MAX_PORTS 65536

## Set the distribution protocol
-proto_dist inet_tcp

## Increase the default stack size
+hms 65536

## Crash dump settings
-env ERL_CRASH_DUMP_SECONDS 5
